(   ultraviolet \(UV\) laser light \(lambda ~ 244 nm or 193 nm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Uses two-beam holographic interferometry or a phase mask.) Tj
T*
(   - Permanent UV-induced defect centers cause a permanent periodic sinusoidal modulation of the) Tj
T*
(   core refractive index \(Delta_n ~ 10^-5 to 10^-3\) with spatial pitch Lambda \(~ 500 nm\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Bragg Resonance Condition:) Tj
T*
(   - When broadband light is launched down the fiber core, each individual index perturbation) Tj
T*
(   reflects a microscopic fraction of light.) Tj
T*
(   - Constructive interference between successive reflected wavelets occurs when the round-trip) Tj
T*
(   phase difference equals an integer multiple of 2*pi:) Tj
T*
(   2 * \(effective path\) = m * lambda_B => 2 * \(n_eff * Lambda\) = lambda_B \(for first order m = 1\).) Tj
T*
(   - The Bragg Wavelength lambda_B is strictly governed by:) Tj
T*
(   lambda_B = 2 * n_eff * Lambda,) Tj
T*
(   where n_eff is the effective mode index and Lambda is the grating period.) Tj
T*
(   - All other wavelengths pass through the grating unattenuated, while a very narrow spectral) Tj
T*
(   notch \(~ 0.2 nm FWHM\) centered at lambda_B is reflected.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Sensing Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   - Any external physical disturbance that alters grating pitch Lambda or refractive index n_eff) Tj
T*
(   directly shifts the reflected Bragg wavelength:) Tj
T*
(   Delta_lambda_B = 2 * \( Delta_n_eff * Lambda + n_eff * Delta_Lambda \).) Tj
T*
(   - Shift due to Mechanical Strain \(epsilon\): Physical stretching expands pitch \(Delta_Lambda =) Tj
T*
(   Lambda * epsilon\) and alters index via photoelastic effect:) Tj
T*
(   \(Delta_lambda_B\)_strain = lambda_B * \(1 - p_e\) * epsilon \(~ 1.2 pm / microstrain at 1550 nm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Shift due to Temperature \(Delta_T\): Thermal expansion expands pitch \(alpha_th\) and) Tj
T*
(   thermo-optic effect alters index \(xi = \(1/n\)*dn/dT\):) Tj
T*
(   \(Delta_lambda_B\)_temp = lambda_B * \(alpha_th + xi\) * Delta_T \(~ 10 pm / C at 1550 nm\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
