(   [Problem Statement]: Explain how optical fiber sensors are deployed for Structural Health Monitoring \(SHM\) of bridges, concrete dams, and tunnels. Describe installation techniques and environmental packaging.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Bridge Infrastructure Monitoring:) Tj
T*
(   - Stay-Cable Tension Monitoring: FBG sensors installed directly on high-strength steel strands) Tj
T*
(   measure dynamic stress variations under heavy traffic loads and wind storms.) Tj
T*
(   - Girder Deflection and Bending Strain: Long-gauge FBG sensors \(1 to 2 m gauge length\) mounted) Tj
T*
(   along top and bottom concrete flanges measure neutral axis migration and flexural strain.) Tj
T*
(   - Expansion Joint Kinematics: Fiber Fabry-Perot displacement sensors monitor cyclic thermal) Tj
T*
(   expansion and joint seizure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Concrete Dam Monitoring:) Tj
T*
(   - Mass Concrete Hydration: During casting of massive gravity dam monoliths, cement hydration) Tj
T*
(   generates internal temperatures exceeding 65 C, risking severe thermal cracking. Embedded FBG) Tj
T*
(   temperature arrays map internal thermal gradients in real time.) Tj
T*
(   - Foundation Seepage Detection: Distributed Raman DTS cables buried in the downstream dam toe) Tj
T*
(   detect localized temperature drops caused by water seepage through bedrock joints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Tunnel and Retaining Wall Monitoring:) Tj
T*
(   - Convergence Monitoring: Fiber sensor cables embedded into shotcrete tunnel liners monitor) Tj
T*
(   ovalization and rock overburden pressure during excavation.) Tj
T*
(   - Landslide and Slope Stability: Armored fiber cables installed in vertical boreholes detect) Tj
T*
(   shear plane deformation via distributed Brillouin sensing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Environmental Packaging and Ruggedization:) Tj
T*
(   - Bare silica glass \(125 um\) is extremely fragile and vulnerable to moisture-assisted stress) Tj
T*
(   corrosion.) Tj
T*
(   - Civil packaging utilizes stainless steel capillary tubes, fiber-reinforced polymer \(FRP\)) Tj
T*
(   pultruded rods, or armored steel braided jackets.) Tj
T*
(   - Sensors are welded to steel rebars or embedded in high-modulus thixotropic epoxy grouts to) Tj
T*
(   guarantee 100% strain transfer from concrete to fiber core.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
