(   - Total loss required for 1% transmission:) Tj
T*
(   Loss_1% = 10 * log10\( 1 / 0.01 \) = 10 * log10\(100\) = 20.0 dB.) Tj
T*
(   - L_1% = Loss_1% / alpha = 20.0 dB / \(0.2354 dB/km\) = 84.96 kilometers.) Tj
T*
